      "key":"gtl_operative_publication",
      "statement":"Publish public graph-function carriers, traversed graph(s), typed node/vector surfaces and semantic jobs or equivalent outer callable contracts bound to the public carrier. Do not bind callers directly to hidden inner vectors. Refining public carriers must explicitly publish live traversal boundaries through lawful GTL surfaces such as RefinementBoundary or CandidateFamily; outer public carrier remains callable contract.",
